        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Acorn KT6JI, S Grip Stainless Steel Mortise Lockset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nStunning at 16\" long, the S Grip Stainless Steel Mortise Handleset With Lever will surely make a statement on bigger doors. Made out of hand forged stainless steel, the natural finish has an uneven pattern similar to antique nickel or pewter. This mortise cylinder lockset is timeless and will look great with almost any decor. It is available in a single cylinder and dummy functions for 1-3/4\" thick doors with a 2-3/4\" backset.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/ACO-Mortise-Specifications.gif?v=1704354518\" width=\"255\" height=\"273\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Acorn Mortise Lock Specifications\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the S Grip Stainless Steel Mortise Handleset With Lever:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Stainless Steel</b></li>\r\n<li>Exterior Plate Height: 16\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Plate Width: 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Handle Projection: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Plate Height: 9-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Plate Width: 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Lever Length: 4-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Lever Width: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Lever Projection: 1-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Stile Width: Recommend 4-1/2” with a 4-1/4” minimum.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Dummy Handleset:</b> Blank trim for non-working doors that does not have a turnpiece or a cylinder. It does not latch and does not lock. Usually used as matching trim for the non-working side of double doors.</li>\r\n<li><b>Single Cylinder Handleset:</b> A key operates the deadbolt from the exterior while a thumbturn operates it from the interior. The latch is operated by a lever from both the exterior and the interior.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe handing actually refers to the mortise lock, rather than the lever. <a href=\"/pages/how-to-order-door-hardware\"><b>Click Here to Determine Handing</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Due to the handmade craftsman nature of this product, all dimensions are approximate. DO NOT DRILL ANY HOLES until you have the actual pieces to be mounted.</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
