                "description": "S Grip Stainless Steel Mortise Lockset Acorn KT6JI - Stunning at 16 inches long, the S Grip Stainless Steel Mortise Handleset With Lever will surely make a statement on bigger doors. Made out of hand forged stainless steel, the natural finish has an uneven pattern similar to antique nickel or pewter. This mortise cylinder lockset is timeless and will look great with almost any decor. It is available in a single cylinder and dummy functions for 1-3/4 inch thick doors with a 2-3/4 inch backset.",
